  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v9.0.0: Subprotocols are now actually sent in the handshake; close status codes are sent big-endian (RFC 6455); ExcludeZeroApplicationDataInPong is now honored; the CancellationToken passed to WebsocketConnectObservable is now forwarded. More robust error handling and resource cleanup. Breaking: ClientWebSocketRx is now a class (was a record) and its TcpClient property is nullable. See README for details.",
